komodo: wake the Exynos UFS host ABL leaves clock-gated (ungate + DME_HIBERNATE_EXIT)

Read-only probe 2026-11-02: HCI_MISC 0xde0 (CLK_CTRL_EN set = clocks gated), every
TUR stuck in the doorbell with OCS 0xf and IS 0. Linux wakes this host with
exynos_ufs_pre_hibern8(): ungate clocks, then UIC DME_HIBERNATE_EXIT. ufsmode bit3.

